desc: Append a semicolon to every line
category: manual
par: 7
hint1: Visual block can append past ragged line ends
hint2: Ctrl-V, then $ to select to each line's end, then A to append
solution: <C-V>jj$A;<Esc>
note: <C-V> block selection, jj down, $ extends to each (ragged) line end, A appends
note: ';' after every line, <Esc> applies it to all.
--- START ---
a = 1
b = 2
c = 3
--- GOAL ---
a = 1;
b = 2;
c = 3;
--- END ---
